Package: expenseMonitor
Title: Analyse and Visualise Personal Receipts
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Marta", "Wojnowska", email = "quickattack313@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A Shiny application for uploading, validating, and visualising
    personal expense data extracted from receipts. Users upload a CSV or
    Excel file, the data is checked against a set of required columns and
    value constraints, and validated records can be explored through
    interactive visual analytics.
